# Waking the Beast (otherAreas 32): La Theine Plateau's qm3 (no script; default STRANGE_ENERGY; I Can Hear a Rainbow and
# CoP 5-3 off here), the six Cloisters' Waking the Beast battlefields (index 2 or 3: option index * 16 + area 1) and the
# Full Moon Fountain's. Five avatar spells by header lines: qm3: no section (STRANGE_ENERGY). Ramuh by a step: 207,
# finished: the Rainbow Resonator, begun. qm3 again: accepted, no ruby: no section. Each Cloister: the entrance's menu,
# area 1 entered, the Prime killed (allDeath: its elementals die, WON), 32001 finished: battlefieldWin its id: the eye.
# The Full Moon Fountain: entered, won (bfwin: the fight cannot be driven by kills), 32001 finished on 0: battlefieldWin
# 226: the six eyes and the resonator taken, the Faded Ruby, Option 1. qm3: the ruby: 208, finished: completed (the
# pole), completedThisWeek 1 until the tally (1800198000), the ruby taken, Interrupter of Dreams (Option 1, read before
# quest:complete clears it: user ruling 2026-11-04, kept Lua bugs; the Lua read it after, always 0: Disturber of
# Slumber; Option 0's Disturber is #edges'). qm3: completedThisWeek 1: no section: STRANGE_ENERGY.
lists LaTheinePlateau/qm3/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/207 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/208 CloisterOfFlames/onEventFinish/32001 CloisterOfFrost/onEventFinish/32001 CloisterOfGales/onEventFinish/32001 CloisterOfStorms/onEventFinish/32001 CloisterOfTides/onEventFinish/32001 CloisterOfTremors/onEventFinish/32001 FullMoonFountain/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-178.2,8.8,254.3 job=SMN lvl=75
spell 298
spell 299
spell 300
spell 301
spell 302
login
